<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Join the Club | Whisperwell</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-cream font-sans text-ink">
  <header class="border-b-2 border-ink/10 bg-cream/95">
    <nav class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-5 py-5 lg:px-8">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3" aria-label="Whisperwell home">
        <span class="grid h-10 w-10 rotate-3 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink text-xl text-mint shadow-[4px_4px_0_#ff6b5f]">✦</span>
        <span class="text-xl font-black tracking-tight">Whisperwell</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="rounded-full border-2 border-ink px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold transition hover:bg-ink hover:text-white">Back to the well</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-5 py-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <section>
      <p class="mb-5 inline-flex rotate-[-2deg] rounded-full bg-coral px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white shadow-[3px_3px_0_#20243a]">Members only</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-xl font-display text-5xl leading-tight sm:text-7xl">Know the <span class="text-coral">secret?</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">The clubhouse door is just a code away. Enter the passcode shared with you and unlock the names behind the whispers.</p>
      <div class="relative mt-10 flex max-w-lg items-end justify-center rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink/10 bg-mint/60 p-5 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#e6ddff]">
        <div class="absolute -left-6 -top-6 h-20 w-20 rounded-full bg-lilac/80"></div>
        <img src="/images/whisperwell-owl-smile.png" alt="A smiling owl guarding the clubhouse secret" class="relative z-10 h-52 w-52 object-contain transition duration-500 hover:-rotate-6 hover:scale-110">
        <span class="absolute right-5 top-5 z-20 rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm font-black shadow-[3px_3px_0_#20243a]">Shh… it’s secret!</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-[9px_9px_0_#c9f5df] sm:p-10">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-coral">One last step</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl">Unlock the clubhouse</h2>
      </div>

      <form action="/join" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
        <div>
          <label for="passcode" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold">Club passcode</label>
          <input id="passcode" name="passcode" type="password" autocomplete="off" required maxlength="100" class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink/15 bg-cream px-4 py-3 text-lg tracking-[0.2em] outline-none transition placeholder:tracking-normal placeholder:text-ink/35 focus:border-coral focus:ring-4 focus:ring-coral/10" placeholder="Enter the secret code">
          <% if (typeof passcodeError !== 'undefined' && passcodeError) { %>
            <p class="mt-3 rounded-xl border border-red-300 bg-red-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-red-700" role="alert" aria-live="polite"><%= passcodeError %></p>
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="w-full rounded-xl bg-ink px-5 py-3.5 font-black text-white shadow-[5px_5px_0_#ff6b5f] transition hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 hover:shadow-none">Open the door <span class="ml-1 text-xl">↗</span></button>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-ink/55">Members can see who is behind each whisper.</p>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
